<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Barber Prestige | Expert Tondeuses</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* --- VARIABLES & RESET --- */
        :root {
            --primary-gold: #ffcc00;
            --deep-black: #0a0a0a;
            --soft-black: #1a1a1a;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --gray: #888888;
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--deep-black);
            color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', cursive;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        /* --- NAVIGATION --- */
        nav {
            background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.95);
            height: 80px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 5%;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-gold);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary-gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links li {
            margin-left: 30px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--white);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-gold);
        }

        /* --- HERO SECTION --- */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.7)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503951914875-452162b0f3f1?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1920');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .hero span {
            color: var(--primary-gold);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: var(--primary-gold);
            color: var(--deep-black);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--white);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        /* --- SERVICES --- */
        .section {
            padding: 100px 10%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .section-title span {
            color: var(--primary-gold);
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .service-card {
            background: var(--soft-black);
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-gold);
            transform: translateY(-10px);
        }

        .service-card i {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--primary-gold);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* --- COLLABORATION TONDEUSES --- */
        .collab-section {
            background: var(--soft-black);
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        .collab-img {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
        }

        .collab-img img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 5px solid var(--primary-gold);
        }

        .collab-text {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
        }

        .price-tag {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--primary-gold);
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue';
        }

        /* --- GALLERY --- */
        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .gallery-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            object-fit: cover;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .gallery-item img:hover {
            filter: grayscale(0%);
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer {
            background: var(--soft-black);
            padding: 50px 10%;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--primary-gold);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .social-links a {
            color: var(--white);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 0 15px;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-gold);
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Barber<span>Shop</span></div>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#home">Accueil</a></li>
            <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#collab">Boutique</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>L'ART DE LA <span>BARBE</span></h1>
        <p>Le style n'est pas une option, c'est un héritage. Découvrez notre savoir-faire unique et nos outils de précision professionnels.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn">Prendre RDV</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="services">
        <h2 class="section-title">Nos <span>Services</span></h2>
        <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card">
                <i class="fas fa-cut"></i>
                <h3>Coupe Classique</h3>
                <p>Un style intemporel sculpté aux ciseaux et à la tondeuse de précision.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i>
                <h3>Taille de Barbe</h3>
                <p>Dessin des contours et soin à l'huile chaude pour une barbe parfaite.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <i class="fas fa-hot-tub"></i>
                <h3>Rasage Traditionnel</h3>
                <p>Le rituel complet avec serviette chaude et coupe-chou.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section collab-section" id="collab">
        <div class="collab-img">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621607512214-68297480165e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" alt="Tondeuse Pro">
        </div>
        <div class="collab-text">
            <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left;">Édition <span>Limitée</span></h2>
            <p>En exclusivité dans notre salon : La Tondeuse Professionnelle Gold Edition. Puissance, précision et design ergonomique pour les hommes exigeants.</p>
            <div class="price-tag">160 DH</div>
            <p><i class="fas fa-truck" style="color: var(--primary-gold);"></i> Livraison disponible à Rabat & Salé</p>
            <br>
            <a href="https://wa.me/212600000000" class="btn">Commander via WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Notre <span>Style</span></h2>
        <div class="gallery-grid">
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512690199101-8d8eb8bbd914?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" alt="Barbe 1"></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621605815841-aa33c54431cc?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" alt="Barbe 2"></div>
            <div class="gallery-item"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431247-f5091e3c339e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" alt="Barbe 3"></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer id="contact">
        <div class="logo">Barber<span>Shop</span></div>
        <p>Avenue Mohammed V, Rabat, Maroc</p>
        <p>Suivez-nous sur les réseaux sociaux</p>
        <div class="social-links" style="margin: 20px 0;">
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a>
            <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i></a>
        </div>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Barber Prestige - Collaboration Officielle Tondeuses</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
